              matters, and how to get the most out of learning it here.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- VIDEO PLACEHOLDER — no video recorded yet. To go live: replace
               this whole .video-placeholder <div> with a real embed, e.g.
               <iframe width="100%" height="100%" style="aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);"
