                An introduction to ASL, recorded by LinguaWave community
                members: captioned, with a Deaf or hard-of-hearing presenter
                signing, not just narration. Once it's live here, it'll also
                go up on our
                <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@Lingua_Wave" target="_blank" rel="noopener">YouTube channel</a>.
              </p>
