         this job (a page's single biggest headline) but wasn't in use
         anywhere yet — using it here is what actually makes the hero
         out-rank the stats/quote/topic-grid below it, rather than the
         previous --fs-3xl (2.25rem), which is the same size h1 already
         used lower down for "Browse Topics"/"What is ASL?". */
      font-size: var(--fs-hero); line-height: 1.05; margin: 0;
