       hero/quote/topic-grid sections above it. Centering it here, as a
       page-scoped override, keeps every section on the same visual
       "spine" without touching the shared rule other pages still use. */
    .unit-info { margin-inline: auto; }
  </style>
  <!-- Role guard: admin -> admin pages only, learners -> out of admin pages. Keep synchronous, in <head>. -->
  <script src="../js/role-guard.js"></script>
