| 09-14 (V naming removal — one real regression found and fixed: bare `lesson.html?level=...` links) | Reported by real click-through: navigating to the Dictionary/camera-practice flow via a chip/course-sidebar/"Needs Review" link produced "No lesson found" on pages/lesson.html. Root cause: the 09-13 rename's substitution rules only matched `pages/lesson.html`/`js/lesson.js` (with the `pages/`/`js/` prefix) when repointing old camera-page references — several files build the camera page's URL as a bare template literal with no folder prefix (`` `lesson.html?level=${...}&category=${...}` ``), which the rename script's substring rules never matched, so they silently kept pointing at the string "lesson.html" — which after the rename is a DIFFERENT page (the mission-flow lesson, expecting `?mission=`, not `?level=&category=`). Fixed every one: `js/lesson.js`'s `cameraPracticeLinkHtml()` ("Practice with your camera" link), `js/mission-overview.js`'s `dictUrl` (Dictionary chip links), `js/progress-page.js`'s Needs-Review `href`/`startHref`, and `js/camera-practice.js`'s own self-referencing sign-to-sign/course-sidebar navigation (4 spots) — all now build `camera-practice.html?level=...` instead. Left `js/mission-overview.js`'s/`js/mastery-quiz.js`'s `` `lesson.html?mission=...` `` links untouched — those already use the correct param signature for the real (renamed) mission-flow page. Also fixed 3 stale doc-comments in `js/camera-practice.js` that still said `lesson.html?...` in prose. Verified: `node --check` clean on all 4 touched files; grepped for every remaining bare `lesson.html` string afterward — only the two correct `?mission=` links remain. **Lesson for future renames on this project:** a rename-by-substring pass has to search for bare, unprefixed filename mentions inside template literals too, not just `pages/X`/`js/X`-prefixed ones — this is the second time in this app's history a URL string in a JS template literal was the thing a path-prefix-based find/replace missed (see the CATEGORY_GROUPS gap and sign-chip-green regression noted elsewhere in this file for the same category of miss). | `js/lesson.js`, `js/mission-overview.js`, `js/progress-page.js`, `js/camera-practice.js`, `AI_MEMORY.md` |
